+# FLAMINGO — one-leg balance + head tuck ("flamingo nap")
+#
+# Physics measured before design (scratchpad settle/CoM scans, 2026-08-29):
+#   - Whole-body CoM sits ~41 mm from either foot's center at STAND; joints
