+#     One-foot balance therefore REQUIRES leaning the whole body 10-25° toward
+#     the stance foot — a verticality reward would fight the physics, so the
+#     composite below prices contacts/height/tuck and leaves trunk roll free
+#     up to a loose fallen-ceiling.
+#   - 103 statically balanced one-foot configs exist (CoM inside the ~38 mm
+#     sole patch, margins ≤ 5 mm), but NONE survive a fixed-ctrl hold: like
+#     walking, the pose is only reachable through active balance. The head
+#     (38% of body mass, fast yaw) is the balance arm — head-nap styling must
+#     stay at weight 0 until the balance skill exists (see the env curricula).
+# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
